WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.633
Here's one,

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:10.200
a picture puzzle!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.800
Which shape completes the pattern?

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:13.333
A.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:14.900
A filled circle,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:15.433
B.

00:00:15.433 --> 00:00:17.000
An empty triangle,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:17.500
C.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.067
A filled square,

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:20.100
or D.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.667
A filled triangle?

00:00:21.667 --> 00:00:22.733
Five seconds!

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:29.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:31.633
The answer is...

00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:32.033
D,

00:00:32.033 --> 00:00:33.300
a filled triangle!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.800
The rule is the shape gets

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.300
filled in but stays the same

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:38.700
shape,

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.200
so the empty triangle becomes a

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.033
filled triangle.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:43.833
Alright,

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:45.700
a word analogy!

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.200
Bee is to hive,

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.667
as bird is to...

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:51.300
what?

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:51.933
A.

00:00:51.933 --> 00:00:52.567
Nest,

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:53.167
B.

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:53.800
Tree,

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:54.433
C.

00:00:54.433 --> 00:00:55.033
Egg,

00:00:55.033 --> 00:00:56.300
or D.

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:56.900
Sky?

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.167
Five seconds!

00:01:03.933 --> 00:01:05.133
TIME'S UP!

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.233
It's...

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:06.633
A,

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:07.067
nest!

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.600
A bee lives in a hive,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.167
so a bird lives in a

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:12.567
nest.

00:01:12.567 --> 00:01:15.100
Each one is the home that

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:15.967
animal builds.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:17.733
Okay,

00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:19.633
a number series!

00:01:19.633 --> 00:01:20.267
Two,

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:20.867
three,

00:01:20.867 --> 00:01:21.500
five,

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:22.133
eight,

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:22.767
thirteen,

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:24.033
and then...

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:25.933
what comes next?

00:01:25.933 --> 00:01:26.567
A.

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:27.200
Eighteen,

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:27.833
B.

00:01:27.833 --> 00:01:28.433
Twenty,

00:01:28.433 --> 00:01:29.067
C.

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:29.700
Twenty-one,

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:30.967
or D.

00:01:30.967 --> 00:01:31.600
Twenty-six?

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:32.867
Five seconds!

00:01:38.633 --> 00:01:39.833
TIME'S UP!

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.033
The answer is...

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:42.533
C,

00:01:42.533 --> 00:01:43.067
twenty-one!

00:01:43.067 --> 00:01:46.100
Add the two numbers before it:

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.667
eight plus thirteen is twenty-one.

00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:51.233
It is the add-the-last-two pattern.

00:01:52.367 --> 00:01:52.900
Okay,

00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:54.500
a picture puzzle!

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.667
Where does the dot move next?

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:58.200
A.

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:58.733
Top-left,

00:01:58.733 --> 00:01:59.267
B.

00:01:59.267 --> 00:01:59.767
Bottom-right,

00:01:59.767 --> 00:02:00.300
C.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:00.833
Center,

00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:01.900
or D.

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:02.433
Bottom-left?

00:02:02.433 --> 00:02:03.500
Five seconds!

00:02:09.267 --> 00:02:10.467
TIME'S UP!

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:12.667
The answer is...

00:02:12.667 --> 00:02:13.167
B,

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:13.667
bottom-right!

00:02:13.667 --> 00:02:16.200
The dot steps clockwise corner

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:17.200
to corner:

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:17.733
bottom-left,

00:02:17.733 --> 00:02:18.233
top-left,

00:02:18.233 --> 00:02:18.733
top-right,

00:02:18.733 --> 00:02:21.767
so the next corner is bottom-right.

00:02:22.933 --> 00:02:23.567
Alright!

00:02:23.567 --> 00:02:26.767
Which one does NOT belong?

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:27.400
A.

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:28.067
Piano,

00:02:28.067 --> 00:02:28.700
B.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:29.333
Guitar,

00:02:29.333 --> 00:02:29.967
C.

00:02:29.967 --> 00:02:30.600
Drum,

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:31.900
or D.

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:32.533
Song?

00:02:32.533 --> 00:02:33.800
Five seconds!

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.800
TIME'S UP!

00:02:41.467 --> 00:02:41.867
It's...

00:02:41.867 --> 00:02:42.300
D,

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:42.700
song!

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.533
A piano,

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:43.967
guitar,

00:02:43.967 --> 00:02:46.467
and drum are all instruments you

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:46.867
play.

00:02:46.867 --> 00:02:49.367
A song is the music they

00:02:49.367 --> 00:02:49.800
make,

00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:51.867
so it does not belong.

00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:54.267
Here's one,

00:02:54.267 --> 00:02:56.067
a number series!

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:56.700
One,

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:57.300
two,

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:57.900
five,

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:58.500
ten,

00:02:58.500 --> 00:02:59.133
seventeen,

00:02:59.133 --> 00:03:00.333
and then...

00:03:00.333 --> 00:03:02.167
what comes next?

00:03:02.167 --> 00:03:02.767
A.

00:03:02.767 --> 00:03:03.400
Twenty-four,

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.000
B.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:04.600
Twenty-six,

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:05.233
C.

00:03:05.233 --> 00:03:05.833
Twenty-five,

00:03:05.833 --> 00:03:07.033
or D.

00:03:07.033 --> 00:03:07.667
Twenty-eight?

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:08.867
Five seconds!

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:15.867
TIME'S UP!

00:03:16.533 --> 00:03:18.267
The answer is...

00:03:18.267 --> 00:03:18.867
B,

00:03:18.867 --> 00:03:19.433
twenty-six!

00:03:19.433 --> 00:03:22.933
The gaps are the odd numbers

00:03:22.933 --> 00:03:23.500
one,

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.100
three,

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:24.667
five,

00:03:24.667 --> 00:03:25.233
seven,

00:03:25.233 --> 00:03:26.400
then nine.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:29.900
So seventeen plus nine is twenty-six.

00:03:31.033 --> 00:03:32.167
Here's one,

00:03:32.167 --> 00:03:33.867
a shape puzzle!

00:03:33.867 --> 00:03:36.100
Which shape comes next?

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:36.667
A.

00:03:36.667 --> 00:03:37.800
A triangle,

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:38.367
B.

00:03:38.367 --> 00:03:39.467
A square,

00:03:39.467 --> 00:03:40.033
C.

00:03:40.033 --> 00:03:41.167
A circle,

00:03:41.167 --> 00:03:42.300
or D.

00:03:42.300 --> 00:03:43.433
A pentagon?

00:03:43.433 --> 00:03:44.567
Five seconds!

00:03:50.333 --> 00:03:51.533
TIME'S UP!

00:03:52.200 --> 00:03:53.633
The answer is...

00:03:53.633 --> 00:03:54.133
A,

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.067
a triangle!

00:03:55.067 --> 00:03:57.967
The sides count down by one:

00:03:57.967 --> 00:03:58.933
hexagon six,

00:03:58.933 --> 00:03:59.867
pentagon five,

00:03:59.867 --> 00:04:00.833
square four,

00:04:00.833 --> 00:04:03.733
so next is the triangle with

00:04:03.733 --> 00:04:04.667
three sides.

00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:06.467
Alright,

00:04:06.467 --> 00:04:08.300
a number analogy!

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.167
Two makes three,

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:12.000
three makes five,

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.867
four makes seven,

00:04:13.867 --> 00:04:15.700
so five makes...

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:16.333
what?

00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:16.933
A.

00:04:16.933 --> 00:04:17.567
Eight,

00:04:17.567 --> 00:04:18.167
B.

00:04:18.167 --> 00:04:18.800
Ten,

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:19.400
C.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.033
Eleven,

00:04:20.033 --> 00:04:21.267
or D.

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:21.867
Nine?

00:04:21.867 --> 00:04:23.100
Five seconds!

00:04:28.900 --> 00:04:30.100
TIME'S UP!

00:04:30.767 --> 00:04:31.267
It's...

00:04:31.267 --> 00:04:31.800
D,

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:32.300
nine!

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.367
Each number is doubled then take

00:04:35.367 --> 00:04:36.400
away one:

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.967
five times two is ten,

00:04:38.967 --> 00:04:41.000
minus one is nine.

00:04:42.167 --> 00:04:43.667
Check this out,

00:04:43.667 --> 00:04:45.667
fill in the blank!

00:04:45.667 --> 00:04:48.667
The library was so quiet that

00:04:48.667 --> 00:04:51.133
even a whisper seemed blank,

00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:54.133
so everyone tried hard not to

00:04:54.133 --> 00:04:55.633
make a sound.

00:04:55.633 --> 00:04:56.133
A.

00:04:56.133 --> 00:04:56.633
Heavy,

00:04:56.633 --> 00:04:57.133
B.

00:04:57.133 --> 00:04:57.633
Loud,

00:04:57.633 --> 00:04:58.133
C.

00:04:58.133 --> 00:04:58.633
Colorful,

00:04:58.633 --> 00:04:59.633
or D.

00:04:59.633 --> 00:05:00.133
Expensive?

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.133
Five seconds!

00:05:06.900 --> 00:05:08.100
TIME'S UP!

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:09.200
It's...

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:09.633
B,

00:05:09.633 --> 00:05:10.033
loud!

00:05:10.033 --> 00:05:12.167
In a place that quiet,

00:05:12.167 --> 00:05:14.733
even a tiny whisper stands out

00:05:14.733 --> 00:05:16.000
and seems loud.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.133
Only loud fits the meaning.

00:05:19.267 --> 00:05:20.333
Here's one,

00:05:20.333 --> 00:05:21.900
a number puzzle,

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:23.500
and it's sneaky!

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:26.667
If two plus three makes ten,

00:05:26.667 --> 00:05:29.300
four plus one makes ten,

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.967
five plus two makes fourteen,

00:05:31.967 --> 00:05:34.600
then three plus four makes...

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:35.133
what?

00:05:35.133 --> 00:05:35.667
A.

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:36.200
Seven,

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:36.700
B.

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.233
Twelve,

00:05:37.233 --> 00:05:37.767
C.

00:05:37.767 --> 00:05:38.300
Fourteen,

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:39.367
or D.

00:05:39.367 --> 00:05:39.900
Twenty-four?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:40.933
Five seconds!

00:05:46.733 --> 00:05:47.933
TIME'S UP!

00:05:48.600 --> 00:05:49.900
The answer is...

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:50.333
C,

00:05:50.333 --> 00:05:50.800
fourteen!

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:53.400
The trick is to add the

00:05:53.400 --> 00:05:54.267
two numbers,

00:05:54.267 --> 00:05:55.167
then double:

00:05:55.167 --> 00:05:57.333
three plus four is seven,

00:05:57.333 --> 00:05:59.967
and seven times two is fourteen.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:01.500
So,

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:03.533
are you smart or fart?

00:06:03.533 --> 00:06:05.967
Count up your correct answers to

00:06:05.967 --> 00:06:07.167
find your rank!

00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:08.700
So,

00:06:08.700 --> 00:06:10.133
how did you do?

00:06:10.133 --> 00:06:11.600
Comment your score below,

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.067
and subscribe for more!
